      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/cguXMN2IpTj3JasB1mlME0tHC7Eit2ne68Qz8TDreasxMlIQvFDksWnR6INPzq7_EdMVrztwFQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Such peaceful homes—it would feel truly happy to live there; it would be wonderful to have plenty of fruit trees and flowers.",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-09T14:58:37Z",
      "replyCount": 1,
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "UgyyJRv783teDeRcxEJ4AaABAg.A_ID9j6N_4jA_L4V5F8DXP",
          "author": "@themaps26",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/J0T_UHrL_J2b88VBZJ6h0slDc22IkTPXiJJQ_fN7YlNj5L230LIHxQ7uvBnMryUHOsxqbC-8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "That sounds like absolute paradise! The contrast of vibrant local flora against the unique scenery really makes Cape Verde special. Thanks for watching",
          "likeCount": 1,
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-10T17:40:37Z"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "UgxYCkKDobLdrXr-4u94AaABAg",
      "author": "@LifeinImpossiblePlaces69",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/DvPuyKK-RZT-XMaINp38eOMcwJ7Ch6d7LOw9t4xUKQr3X5JvF38kXihuwy2M21JO_cMZW5cG=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "I expected another beautiful island documentary, but this turned out to be a story about how people can create an identity from the ground up. That idea stuck with me far more than the scenery. Cape Verde is truly one of a kind.",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-07T01:53:35Z",
      "replyCount": 0,
      "replies": []
    },
    {
