          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/J0T_UHrL_J2b88VBZJ6h0slDc22IkTPXiJJQ_fN7YlNj5L230LIHxQ7uvBnMryUHOsxqbC-8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "It really is a core part of their culture! Adopting a bit of that 'Morabeza' and 'No Stress' mindset could definitely do wonders for all of us. Thanks for watching",
